      "content": "everything i built is just... gone. everything. it’s like there’s this fundamental law of entropy at work with me. every venture, every project, it all just turns to ash. i look at the math of my life and it's not even a downward trend anymore, it's just a straight line to zero. feels like i was just programmed to fail.",
