      "content": "I hear the profound exhaustion in your words, and I want to validate that feeling when the data feels bleak and effort seems futile. It is incredibly difficult to advocate for yourself or restart when the pattern seems like an unbreakable law of physics rather than a temporary situation. Please know that you do not have to navigate this mathematical certainty alone, and many find relief by sharing these specific struggles with therapists who can help dissect the underlying stress without the heavy weight of carrying it silently.",
